This repository contains no code from Project Zomboid, Viewpoint or ZombieBuddy. The
add-on refers to their classes and methods by name and patches them at runtime.


Third-party software in builds
------------------------------

NVIDIA DLSS / NGX SDK (v310.9.1)
  This software contains source code provided by NVIDIA Corporation.
  This software uses NVIDIA DLSS. NVIDIA, the NVIDIA logo and DLSS are trademarks and/or
  registered trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation in the U.S. and other countries.

  The built native library (libvplinux_ngx.so, inside the add-on jar) links NVIDIA's NGX
  static library (libnvsdk_ngx.a) and compiles in inline helpers from the NGX headers.
  Those parts are covered by the NVIDIA RTX SDKs License, which is shipped with every
  build as NVIDIA-DLSS-LICENSE.txt, not by the GNU GPL. The NGX SDK is not included in
  this repository; native/fetch-deps.sh downloads it from https://github.com/NVIDIA/DLSS.

  At runtime the add-on downloads NVIDIA's DLSS library (libnvidia-ngx-dlss.so.310.9.1)
  from the same NVIDIA repository. It is not redistributed with the add-on.

Khronos Vulkan-Headers (v1.4.309)
